=== harnez agent-collector
Compatibility command for `harnez server`. Runs the local server and usage collector,
which writes normalized observations, history, and JSON snapshots. The --once option keeps
its one-shot snapshot behavior; the systemd user unit runs `harnez server`.

Usage:
  harnez agent-collector [flags]

Flags:
  -h, --help                help for agent-collector
      --interval duration   snapshot collection interval (default 5m0s)
      --offline             disable live network queries and use local caches only
      --once                collect and write snapshots once, then exit (no timer loop)

=== harnez agy-meter-run
Run an AGY process with its private usage meter

Usage:
  harnez agy-meter-run -- command [args...] [flags]

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for agy-meter-run

